---
---

<section class="process">
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <div class="process-content">
    <div class="process-timeline">
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>We chat first</h3>
          <p>You tell me about your baby and any special considerations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Come as you are</h3>
          <p>We meet in a warm, relaxed space; babies can feed, cry, sleep.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>You learn at your baby's pace</h3>
          <p>I demonstrate on a doll; you massage your baby only when they're happy to.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">4</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>You take it home</h3>
          <p>You get notes/oil and keep practising the routine in your own time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="process-illustration">
      <!-- Illustration space - add image here when ready -->
      
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="process-note">
    If your baby sleeps or cries through a session, that's normal. We adapt.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .process {
    padding: var(--spacing-3xl) var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .process h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
  }

  .process-content {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-3xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .process-timeline {
    order: 1;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-xl);
    position: relative;
  }

  .process-illustration {
    order: 2;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .illustration-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: color-mix(in oklab, white 90%, var(--sw-sand));
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    color: var(--sw-ink);
  }

  .illustration-placeholder svg {
    width: 80%;
    height: 80%;
  }

  .process-step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .step-number {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: color-mix(in oklab, white 70%, var(--sw-sage));
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-content h3 {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .step-content p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .process-note {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.9;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .process-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .process-timeline {
      order: 1;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .process-illustration {
      order: 2;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .process-timeline {
      gap: var(--spacing-2xl);
    }

    .step-number {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>

